data.\n\ndata is the data which should be {slice, Ndiff, x, y}.\nbval is the \
bvector whould be length Ndiff.\ninit is the initalization of the bayesian \
fit which comes from IVIMCalC, (without S0 using 3 compartments).\nmask is \
the region in which the bayesian fit is performed.\n\noutput is {f1, f2, dc, \
pdc1, pdc2}. The fractions f1 and f2 are defined between 0 and 1, the dc, \
pdc1 and pdc1 is in mm^2/s.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/BayesianIVIMFit3"|>,
     "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
    "SubValues" -> None, "DefaultValues" -> 
    Information`InformationValueForm[
     DefaultValues, QMRITools`IVIMTools`BayesianIVIMFit3, {
      SyntaxInformation[QMRITools`IVIMTools`BayesianIVIMFit3] -> {
        "ArgumentsPattern" -> {
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           OptionsPattern[]}}}], "NValues" -> None, "FormatValues" -> None, 
    "Options" -> {
     QMRITools`IVIMTools`ChainSteps -> {20000, 1000, 10}, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`UpdateStep -> {0.5, 0.5, 0.1, 0.5, 0.5}, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`FixPseudoDiff -> False, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`CorrectPar -> True, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`OutputSamples -> False, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`FixPseudoDiffSD -> 0.5, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`FitConstrains -> {{0.0005002011070795643, 
       0.9994997988929204}, {0.0005002011070795643, 0.9994997988929204}, {
       0.000045399929762484854`, 0.004086771438464067}, {
       0.0015034391929775724`, 0.10025884372280375`}, {0.0055165644207607716`,
        1.}}}, "Attributes" -> {Protected, ReadProtected}, "FullName" -> 
    "QMRITools`IVIMTools`BayesianIVIMFit3"|>, True]]], "Print",
